-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-breakneck-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"breakneck","sort_order":1,"sense":"極速的","alt_zh":"高中生在教室看電影畫面，專業成年騎士戴全套護具在封閉賽道高速下坡。","example":"The bicycle raced downhill at breakneck speed in the film.","example_zh":"電影裡的腳踏車以極快速度衝下山坡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/breakneck-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-breakthrough-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"breakthrough","sort_order":1,"sense":"突破","alt_zh":"高中生開心托起新完成的輕型模型飛機，舊的笨重零件放在旁邊。","example":"Finding a lighter material was a breakthrough for our model aircraft.","example_zh":"找到更輕的材料，是我們模型飛機製作的一大突破。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/breakthrough-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-brethren-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"brethren","sort_order":1,"sense":"弟兄","alt_zh":"成年修士在樸素修道院門口友善迎接其他修士進入安靜大廳。","example":"The monk welcomed his brethren into the quiet hall.","example_zh":"修士歡迎弟兄們走進安靜的大廳。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/brethren-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bribery-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bribery","sort_order":1,"sense":"賄賂","alt_zh":"成年官員嚴正推回對方遞來的裝錢信封，辦公室氣氛莊重。","example":"The official refused the envelope because accepting it would be bribery.","example_zh":"官員拒收信封，因為接受它就是受賄。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bribery-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-broadband-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"broadband","sort_order":1,"sense":"寬頻","alt_zh":"村落教室中，高中生透過清晰視訊與遠方科學老師一起做實驗。","example":"Broadband allowed the village school to join a live science lesson.","example_zh":"寬頻讓村落學校能參加即時科學課程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/broadband-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-broker-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"broker","sort_order":1,"sense":"經紀人","alt_zh":"房屋經紀人帶家人看房，桌上放著幾間房屋模型與照片。","example":"The broker helped the family compare several homes before buying one.","example_zh":"經紀人幫家人在購屋前比較幾間房子。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/broker-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-brunt-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"brunt","sort_order":1,"sense":"衝擊","alt_zh":"巨大海浪撞上堅固海堤，海堤後方小鎮受到保護，無危險人物。","example":"The old seawall took the brunt of the storm's waves.","example_zh":"老海堤承受了暴風雨海浪的大部分衝擊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/brunt-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-buffer-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"buffer","sort_order":1,"sense":"緩衝","alt_zh":"俯視茂密樹帶隔開校園操場與車流繁忙道路，學生在安全校內活動。","example":"A strip of trees formed a buffer between the playground and the busy road.","example_zh":"一排樹木在操場與繁忙道路之間形成緩衝。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/buffer-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-bulwark-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"bulwark","sort_order":1,"sense":"堡壘；屏障","alt_zh":"厚實石牆擋住上漲河水，後方村落地面仍乾燥安全。","example":"The thick stone wall served as a bulwark against the flood.","example_zh":"厚實石牆成為抵擋洪水的屏障。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/bulwark-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-buoyant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"buoyant","sort_order":1,"sense":"樂觀的","alt_zh":"高中樂團在安全屋簷下等雨停，仍微笑互相鼓勵、整理樂器。","example":"The team remained buoyant despite the rain delaying their performance.","example_zh":"雖然雨勢延誤演出，小組仍保持樂觀。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/buoyant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-byproduct-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"byproduct","sort_order":1,"sense":"副產品","alt_zh":"木匠整理安全切割木料後留下的乾淨鋸木屑，準備再利用。","example":"Sawdust is a useful byproduct of cutting wood.","example_zh":"鋸木屑是切割木材產生的有用副產品。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/byproduct-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-cadre-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"cadre","sort_order":1,"sense":"幹部","alt_zh":"幾名成年志工幹部向新加入的高中志工示範整理救援物資。","example":"A small cadre of experienced volunteers trained the new members.","example_zh":"一小群有經驗的志工幹部訓練新成員。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/cadre-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-calamity-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"calamity","sort_order":1,"sense":"災難","alt_zh":"洪水退去後，村民在受損街道合作搬物資與清掃，無傷者。","example":"The flood was a calamity for the village, but the neighbors helped one another.","example_zh":"洪水對村落是場災難，但鄰居彼此協助。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/calamity-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-caliber-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"caliber","sort_order":1,"sense":"口徑；水準","alt_zh":"成年評審欣賞高中室內樂團精湛演奏，露出讚許表情。","example":"The judges praised the high caliber of the students' musical performance.","example_zh":"評審讚賞學生音樂演出的高水準。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/caliber-01-v1.webp","local_pat