"word":"celestial","sort_order":1,"sense":"天體的","alt_zh":"高中生在天文館球幕下，看老師指出行星、星星與月亮的影像。","example":"The planetarium helped us identify several celestial objects in the night sky.","example_zh":"天文館幫我們辨認夜空中的幾種天體。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/celestial-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-censorship-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"censorship","sort_order":1,"sense":"審查","alt_zh":"高中生在博物館觀察有大段黑條遮蔽的舊報紙，版面無可辨識文字。","example":"The exhibition showed how censorship had hidden parts of old newspapers.","example_zh":"展覽呈現審查制度如何遮蔽舊報紙的部分內容。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/censorship-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-centennial-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"centennial","sort_order":1,"sense":"百年","alt_zh":"城鎮廣場音樂慶典旁展示同一建築昔日與今日的照片，居民歡聚。","example":"The town celebrated its centennial with music in the main square.","example_zh":"城鎮以廣場音樂表演慶祝百年紀念。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/centennial-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-ceramic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"ceramic","sort_order":1,"sense":"陶瓷的","alt_zh":"高中生在陶藝工坊展示剛完成、上釉光滑的陶瓷杯。","example":"The students made ceramic cups in the pottery workshop.","example_zh":"學生在陶藝工坊製作陶瓷杯。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/ceramic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-chancellor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"chancellor","sort_order":1,"sense":"總理；大學校長","alt_zh":"成年大學校長穿正式學袍在典禮講台前向學生致詞，無標誌。","example":"The chancellor addressed the students at the university ceremony.","example_zh":"大學校長在典禮上向學生致詞。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/chancellor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-charisma-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"charisma","sort_order":1,"sense":"魅力","alt_zh":"年輕成年指揮熱情而自信地帶領樂團，團員專注微笑演奏。","example":"The young conductor's charisma inspired the whole orchestra.","example_zh":"年輕指揮的魅力鼓舞了整個管弦樂團。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/charisma-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-charter-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"charter","sort_order":1,"sense":"憲章","alt_zh":"高中社團成員圍桌閱讀正式章程文件，文件無可辨識文字。","example":"The club's charter explained its purpose and basic responsibilities.","example_zh":"社團章程說明它的宗旨與基本責任。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/charter-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-chronicle-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"chronicle","sort_order":1,"sense":"編年史","alt_zh":"高中生沿著博物館時間展示，看漁村逐步成為城鎮的歷史照片，無日期字樣。","example":"The museum's chronicle traced the town's growth from a fishing village.","example_zh":"博物館的編年史追溯城鎮從漁村開始的發展。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/chronicle-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-circulate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"circulate","sort_order":1,"sense":"流通；循環","alt_zh":"高中生看魚缸的小幫浦帶動清水流經水草與濾水器。","example":"A small pump helps water circulate through the classroom aquarium.","example_zh":"小幫浦讓教室魚缸裡的水循環流動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/circulate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-citation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"citation","sort_order":1,"sense":"引用","alt_zh":"高中女生指著報告上的資料來源註記，再指向旁邊查閱的書，文字不可辨識。","example":